{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLTuplet","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL9MXLTupletV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTuplet"}],"symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"title":"MXLTuplet","roleHeading":"Structure"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion"]},{"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/init(id:actual:normal:kind:number:hasBracket:showNumber:showType:lineShape:position:placement:)"]},{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/actual","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/hasBracket","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/id","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/kind","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/lineShape","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/normal","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/number","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/placement","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/position","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/showNumber","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/showType"]},{"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","kind":"